  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Whenever toggling an object with an audiosource using .SetActive(), it fails to set the audiosource to spatial upon being reactivated. This has caused an object with spatial audio to be heard everywhere but still be stereo-dependent on the view of your camera.\n\nVideo for reference: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdCsxnowwKg\n\nEdit: I have found that this is caused specifically by the Use AudioSource Volume Curve boolean when it is toggled on. It does not occur when it is disabled",
